# NAME: Spotify Audio (Direct)
# 作用: 仅分流音频数据与媒体切片走直连，节省节点流量

# Akamai 音频 CDN
DOMAIN,audio4-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,heads-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads4-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net

# pscdn 音频 CDN
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pscdn.co

# Spotify 官方自建音频 CDN (精准匹配音频子域名，不影响封面图)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-fa.scdn.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads-fa.scdn.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-fa.spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio4-fa.spotifycdn.com
